iz ⟨der⟩ kind meg ikh ⟨shoyn hobn azan elter⟩

456
00:22:49,823 --> 00:22:54,761
dos meydele UNK keyn akht yor nisht geven, vayl di akht yor hob ikh ir gemakht dem YOM HULEDET

457
00:22:55,408 --> 00:22:56,384
dos i-

458
00:22:56,384 --> 00:22:59,464
do hob ikh nisht gearbet gornit. shtub.

459
00:22:59,464 --> 00:23:01,629
shtub un di kinder hob ikh aleyn gehat.

460
00:23:03,222 --> 00:23:07,623
ikh hob UNK s'iz nisht zayne kinder. ir hot kinder? yo, undz ho'mir tsvey kinder.

461
00:23:07,623 --> 00:23:09,462
bin ikh gelign in a shpitol

462
00:23:09,462 --> 00:23:13,256
v- ir hot epes kinder? yo, tsvey kinder, a yingele mit a meydele

463
00:23:14,427 --> 00:23:17,672
hot di UNK gezogt "IMA, IMA, IMA"

464
00:23:17,672 --> 00:23:19,519
kh'meg shoyn hobn azan ⟨elter⟩

465
00:23:19,519 --> 00:23:21,305
vosere kind er iz.

466
00:23:24,265 --> 00:23:26,267
koved biz aher UNK.

467
00:23:30,036 --> 00:23:33,017
vos kenstu dertseyltn oyf dayn

468
00:23:33,073 --> 00:23:35,227
fun dayn lebn do in Ashkelon?

469
00:23:37,022 --> 00:23:41,639
do in Ashkelon, vos kon ikh aykh dertseyln? ikh hob nit gehat do keyn shum tsores

470
00:23:41,730 --> 00:23:44,199
funem ershtn tog vos ikh bin arayngekumen

471
00:23:44,199 --> 00:23:45,617
hot er gearbet

472
00:23:45,617 --> 00:23:47,059
bay tog un bay nakht.

473
00:23:47,059 --> 00:23:52,406
er hot nit gevust fun keyn shabes, fun keyn ROSH HASHANA, UNK YOM KIPUR, gornit.

474
00:23:52,598 --> 00:23:57,874
m'hot gevust bay nakht tsu geyn un bay nakht tsu kumen, UNK zol zayn in shtub vos me darf.

475
00:23:57,981 --> 00:24:02,295
a shver lebn, shver iz geven, shtark shver. UNK nisht geholfn

476
00:24:04,107 --> 00:24:08,303
UNK gute vort farshraybt ales, fartraybt ales.

477
00:24:14,687 --> 00:24:15,744
un

478
00:24:17,421 --> 00:24:19,772
du kenst dikh dermonen fun

479
00:24:19,772 --> 00:24:21,096
yene tsaytn

480
00:24:21,096 --> 00:24:22,548
fun CHAGIM

481
00:24:22,548 --> 00:24:25,667
shabes, vi iz dos geven bay aykh in shtub?

482
00:24:25,352 --> 00:24:26,966
un Rumenye?

483
00:24:26,382 --> 00:24:27,203
yo.

484
00:24:28,255 --> 00:24:31,888
bay UNK baben gevoynt, gekhovet gevorn

485
00:24:31,888 --> 00:24:35,471
yidish, yidish UNK yidish

486
00:24:36,253 --> 00:24:40,314
UNK milekh tsi fleyshiks. es iz alding parve.

487
00:24:42,717 --> 00:24:44,095
kedey me zol

488
00:24:42,750 --> 00:24:46,017
un oyf di yontoyvim, vos gedenkstu fun

489
00:24:45,838 --> 00:24:46,895
vi azoy?

490
00:24:47,037 --> 00:24:51,452
yontoyvim oder shabes, vos gedenkst fun di tsaytn?

491
00:24:51,829 --> 00:24:53,459
vos zol ikh gedenken?

492
00:24:53,459 --> 00:24:58,979
di babe iz geven a baleboste un shtub, un der zeyde iz geven a khosid baym reb- baym altn rebn, dem altn.

493
00:25:00,300 --> 00:25:05,730
un z- zey hobn gehat a groysn tish oyf dem yontoyvim? v- vos iz geven in shtub?

494
00:25:04,857 --> 00:25:11,128
di babe iz geven ⟨a orem in shtub⟩ UNK alte, tsvey mentshn, eltere tsvey mentshn. vos hobn zey gekont hobn?

495
00:25:11,134 --> 00:25:16,342
nisht far keynem gezogt gevorn, a gebrokhn harts fun dray tekhter tsu hobn eyniklekh

496
00:25:16,416 --> 00:25:19,937
iz dos m- ⟨mir⟩ gekhovet, un gekhovet nokh a eynikl

497
00:25:20,365 --> 00:25:25,900
fun dray yor a kind vos zi hot dergangen dem, dem, do UNK

498
00:25:25,900 --> 00:25:27,095
dinen

499
00:25:27,095 --> 00:25:32,166
hot er gezogt er vil nisht dinen in Rumenye. er vil forn keyn Rusland. UNK

500
00:25:32,166 --> 00:25:35,935
iz er avek nokh dortn, i- d- nokh dortn, dort geblibn.

501
00:25:37,712 --> 00:25:39,970
un do in shtub, in land

502
00:25:39,970 --> 00:25:41,599
hot ir gehat

503
00:25:42,771 --> 00:25:44,034
hot ir

504
00:25:44,260 --> 00:25:46,990
in di yontoyvim un shabes iz

505
00:25:46,990 --> 00:25:47,578
hot ir

506
00:25:46,993 --> 00:25:49,349
bay m- bay mir shabes iz shabes.

507
00:25:49,033 --> 00:25:49,793
yo?

508
00:25:49,373 --> 00:25:50,720
shabes ver ikh

509
00:25:50,720 --> 00:25:52,837
a gantse vokh iz a gantse vokh

510
00:25:52,837 --> 00:25:55,284
le- lebt men. me shtarbt kholile nit

511
00:25:55,284 --> 00:25:58,887
nor fraytik tsvelef, halb eyns, shoyn di tish gegreyt

512
00:25:58,887 --> 00:26:02,735
un di likht iz oyfn tish, un di khale mitn khale dekl ibergedekt

513
00:26:02,735 --> 00:26:05,831
biz bay di, bay, di tikhele ongegreyt

514
00:26:05,831 --> 00:26:08,604
UNK in top ⟨ot⟩ unter di likht, bay di likht

515
00:26:09,538 --> 00:26:13,481
me darf bentshn likht, kukt er oyfn luekh, v- bay vosere sho

516
00:26:14,145 --> 00:26:19,184
UNK me darf bentshn UNK ⟨ontsutun⟩ di likht, gey ikh UNK bentshn likht.

517
00:26:19,782 --> 00:26:22,999
un in yontoyvim, bistu gegangen in BET KNESET?

518
00:26:22,819 --> 00:26:23,825
vi azoy?

519
00:26:23,022 --> 00:26:24,821
in yontoyvim

520
00:26:25,452 --> 00:26:28,044
in dem CHAGIM, in di yontoyvim

521
00:26:27,780 --> 00:26:28,668
nu?

522
00:26:28,472 --> 00:26:30,980
bistu gegangen in BET KNESET?

523
00:26:30,617 --> 00:26:32,357
BETACH, BETACH.

524
00:26:32,387 --> 00:26:35,924
az ikh kon nokh davenen aleyn. haynt ze ikh nisht

525
00:26:36,083 --> 00:26:38,248
haynt az ikh darf zogn yizker

526
00:26:38,248 --> 00:26:39,738
zog ikh oysnveynik.

527
00:26:41,078 --> 00:26:43,941
ikh nem di tkhine in der haynt, ober ikh leyen nit.

528
00:26:43,963 --> 00:26:46,685
oyf dem ze ikh nisht shoyn tsvelef yor

529
00:26:46,685 --> 00:26:48,446
un dos kumt nokh.

530
00:26:52,080 --> 00:26:53,373
un yetst

531
00:26:53,481 --> 00:26:56,512
kumen di eyniklekh un di

532
00:26:55,708 --> 00:26:57,136
ven un ven.

533
00:26:57,143 --> 00:26:58,791
ven un ven kumen zey.

534
00:26:59,033 --> 00:27:00,928
az ikh hob gezen

535
00:27:00,928 --> 00:27:07,582
flegn oyf a shabes kumen, flegn eyn mol in der vokhn kumen, yontev kumen, s'iz geven ongegreyt ales

536
00:27:07,943 --> 00:27:10,940
nisht breyt, ober balebatish.

537
00:27:11,048 --> 00:27:11,919
haynt

538
00:27:12,195 --> 00:27:15,327
kokh ikh op a tepl, iz shver vegn undz oykhet

539
00:27:16,195 --> 00:27:19,868
darf ikh leygn in te- tepl, fleg ikh leygn in tepl

540
00:27:19,907 --> 00:27:21,707
darf ikh gisn ⟨dem⟩ tepl

541
00:27:21,707 --> 00:27:26,067
gis ikh mit der gaz farlozt, UNK tsu hobn gaz

542
00:27:34,318 --> 00:27:35,088
iz

543
00:27:36,985 --> 00:27:40,168
du g- du geyst a mol tsu, tsu di kinder?

544
00:27:40,208 --> 00:27:41,197
yo.

545
00:27:41,727 --> 00:27:46,496
yo, befor mit yorn ⟨fleg men undz⟩ nemen a sakh mol, a sakh mol

546
00:27:46,654 --> 00:27:49,517
kumen fraytik mit zeyer mashin undz nemen

547
00:27:49,624 --> 00:27:52,790
sh- zuntik oder shabeysenakhts aheymbrengen

548
00:27:52,797 --> 00:27:54,343
UNK kon nisht zogn ⟨mer⟩

549
00:27:56,138 --> 00:28:00,384
UNK geven a UNK tsu ⟨neyen⟩.

550
00:28:00,070 --> 00:28:02,342
un vifl kinder hobn zey?

551
00:28:02,382 --> 00:28:04,890
der zun, vifl kinder hot er?

552
00:28:03,900 --> 00:28:04,974
fir.

553
00:28:05,520 --> 00:28:07,049
di tokhter dray.

554
00:28:07,242 --> 00:28:09,058
du gedenkst di nemener?

555
00:28:09,216 --> 00:28:12,385
yo. SAVTA, SAVTA, SAVTA.

556
00:28:12,385 --> 00:28:14,728
kh'hob ⟨geholfn⟩ di kinder.

557
00:28:17,046 --> 00:28:19,810
du gedenkst di nemener fun di kinder?

558
00:28:19,189 --> 00:28:20,583
yo, vos den?

559
00:28:20,354 --> 00:28:22,084
nu, UNK zog.

560
00:28:21,147 --> 00:28:24,128
dem UNK ⟨dinst⟩ meydl ⟨der⟩ groyse

561
00:28:24,403 --> 00:28:25,494
DALIT

562
00:28:26,007 --> 00:28:27,218
di andere

563
00:28:27,218 --> 00:28:27,857
n-

564
00:28:28,926 --> 00:28:30,607
di andere NIRA

565
00:28:30,647 --> 00:28:31,586
shoyn

566
00:28:31,947 --> 00:28:32,501
ZEHU.

